07_1351545363214646_5506338495222860567_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-rOmDnRYyTEQ7kNvwEbTJFo&_nc_oc=AdqVWYHwKJ9kQfYhbvjZrDO4fSm0qdJRwpWJCU4GYuFTLApkaU84TeBlp735Fgv0K5M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTKIup2NaBFRn06Ttyf4s7nr5Z3CuLPXCTRnhQq_nZ81A&oe=6AEF3342"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LbsoDqnNJ5gQ7kNvwFQACKJ&_nc_oc=Ado97kX7D4jcPCGZ32eOPOeDXg5XlbQZZeWhrSghVioOJV_56OiVQxaeVMMLQKEAMow&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRGIQ8-5Tnvkz-9C0KLCVlFB5f2Lqp3FgPM376pVkcdPw&oe=6AEF60FF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OXfP9qPxAg8Q7kNvwFtjzGa&_nc_oc=AdrLMdSSfeGUukS28-6pbQMQEagwjW87hWNPEk2tWMhhyWqZ5fM9B55RNvRLUWdDVyk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSGgcxnfI1jM_nruGdTu3NVoPnfcCO4rBxR1Ye2-sT_Iw&oe=6AEF37B0"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quic